Vulkan: recover device loss and retry bounded synchronization waits

VK_ERROR_DEVICE_LOST establishes resource completion, not valid rendered pixels.
Retain failed submissions for renderer teardown and emit events.lost. Retry
VK_TIMEOUT for ten one-second slices; unresolved GPU use still cannot return
false to scene submission, which drops deferred client release reservations.
Use the same completion policy for synchronous presentation copies, without
reading lost-device pixel contents or adding waits to healthy direct frames.

Spec: https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/devsandqueues.html#devsandqueues-lost-device

